WEBVTT

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:21.629
I hope there's a
vacant room soon...

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:34.283
(Beast Tamer)

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:42.149
I've always been running
for someone else's sake

00:00:42.170 --> 00:00:46.070
But, you taught me something

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:47.950
The uneasiness to trust someone

00:00:47.979 --> 00:00:49.130
You erased it

00:00:49.159 --> 00:00:49.799
Day by day

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:50.700
I can feel our fate

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:51.810
To say farewell
to this loneliness

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:52.990
I've closed it off

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:54.759
But somehow, from somewhere

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:56.929
Suddenly your voice
melts down my heart

00:00:56.929 --> 00:01:04.989
That night when I closed my heart off,
saying that nobody understands me

00:01:04.989 --> 00:01:12.739
Your warm hand held mine
and melted down my heart

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:16.310
Carry the oath on my chest,
and hope in my heart,

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:18.310
Hold me and fly to the sky

00:01:18.329 --> 00:01:23.370
With the new bond we made

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:26.750
I can become stronger
because you're with me

00:01:26.769 --> 00:01:29.069
I fight for you and I

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:31.400
I won't ever forget your name

00:01:31.430 --> 00:01:37.280
Let's start running again from the start

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:46.170
We'll change the world from now on!

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:54.989
New equipment for me?
(Let's Make a Weapon)

00:01:54.989 --> 00:01:56.829
Yeah, we already talked about it, right?
(Let's Make a Weapon)

00:01:56.829 --> 00:01:57.870
That's right.

00:01:57.870 --> 00:02:01.230
Rein became very strong because
of your contract with me, but...

00:02:01.519 --> 00:02:04.140
My bare hand is not practical
enough, huh...

00:02:06.939 --> 00:02:10.030
This flavor! It brings out the
sweetness of the vegetables so much!

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:12.280
Big sis, this soup is delicious!

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:15.949
Runa, it's impolite to shout
while you're eating.

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:18.030
Geez, you made a mess too...

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:19.620
You're right.

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:23.330
We've filled our stomachs with the
reward from Arios's request anyway so...

00:02:24.039 --> 00:02:25.669
Let's sort out my equipment.

00:02:25.689 --> 00:02:26.250
Yeah.

00:02:28.039 --> 00:02:30.800
I have more friends that
I want to protect too, after all.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.590
As I expected, is filled with humans.

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:38.969
It'll be bad if they
know that we're Fairies.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:40.349
Don't let your guard down, big sis!

00:02:41.389 --> 00:02:43.020
Don't worry!

00:02:43.039 --> 00:02:47.120
This time, I'll make sure to protect
you, no matter what may happen, Runa!

00:02:47.789 --> 00:02:51.479
It'll be fine. I've told you, right?
Not all of us are bad.

00:02:51.979 --> 00:02:53.860
I understand that, but...

00:02:54.879 --> 00:02:57.280
We're a couple of
reclusive Fairies...

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:59.740
It'll take time before
we get used to it.

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:01.740
Stop saying that we're recluses!

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:02.870
Big sis Tania!

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:04.580
Good day!

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.750
You guys came again?
You got a lot of free time.

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:08.379
Yes!

00:03:08.919 --> 00:03:13.939
My pride was broken in Stride Bridge,
and I was depressed for a while, but...

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.050
To think that my
opponent was a Dragono...

00:03:16.069 --> 00:03:19.930
And it was such an honor to have
Big sis Tania as an adventurer!

00:03:20.139 --> 00:03:23.020
We have to show respect to you!

00:03:23.389 --> 00:03:25.639
Well, it can't be helped then!

00:03:25.669 --> 00:03:28.349
Once you got stronger,
I don't mind fighting you again!

00:03:28.379 --> 00:03:29.939
Yes! Big sis Tania!

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:31.610
Hello, auntie!

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:34.689
My my, Kanade is lively as always, huh?

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:36.240
Take this with you.

00:03:36.259 --> 00:03:38.569
Thank you! But, is it okay?

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.069
You helped me out
last time after all.

00:03:41.199 --> 00:03:43.120
If it's okay with you,
I'll ask for your help again sometime!

00:03:43.139 --> 00:03:44.580
Sure! Leave it to me!

00:03:45.039 --> 00:03:47.289
Both Kanade and Tania
are accustomed to it...

00:03:47.909 --> 00:03:49.750
Yeah, even though they're
also the ultimate species...

00:03:52.539 --> 00:03:54.000
What is it?

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.759
I won't give any mercy,
even against children, you know...

00:03:56.919 --> 00:03:59.759
Big bro Rein is bringing
more brides with him!

00:03:59.789 --> 00:04:00.599
What?!

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:02.389
The third and fourth ones!

00:04:02.409 --> 00:04:04.810
Who are you calling
a new bride?!

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:06.810
Don't get so flustered, big sis.

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:09.979
Big sis, you're really cute...
Are you flower fairies?

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:11.310
Cu, cute...

00:04:11.969 --> 00:04:13.479
Thank you very much...

00:04:16.529 --> 00:04:19.910
You got a pair of good eyes
there, little girl!

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:22.740
But,
we are not flower fairies...

00:04:22.949 --> 00:04:26.329
Witness this,
the depth of my wickedness.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:30.500
I am the one who's mastered
the power of evil...

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.800
You two, why did you stop me?!

00:04:34.819 --> 00:04:37.550
When someone expects something,
we should try and fulfill it!

00:04:37.879 --> 00:04:42.759
Did you forget that our Fairy wings
will appear when we use magic?

00:04:43.009 --> 00:04:46.930
We'll get into trouble if they found that
we're Fairies, especially in the town!

00:04:48.019 --> 00:04:51.689
Well, it's fine as you slowly
get used to living here...

00:04:52.439 --> 00:04:53.649
Wait, I think it's here?

00:04:54.519 --> 00:04:57.189
If I remember correctly, this is
the best equipment shop in town, right?

00:04:57.220 --> 00:04:59.819
As I thought, it's important
to be the best in anything.

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:00.949
Alright, let's go!

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:04.410
Welcome.

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:10.620
What is it?
Dwarfs aren't that rare around here.

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:12.250
Ah, I'm sorry.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:15.089
Actually, I'm looking for
some weapons and armor...

00:05:15.209 --> 00:05:17.129
Just choose whatever you like.

00:05:17.329 --> 00:05:20.170
That shopkeeper is pretty scary...

00:05:20.199 --> 00:05:22.889
Well, Dwarfs are full of
eccentric people after all.

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:28.009
I'm convinced that this place is the best in town,
after knowing that the blacksmith is a Dwarf.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:29.519
Rein, Rein!

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:31.480
How about this?

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:32.269
A whip?

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:35.689
Runa, Rein doesn't use a whip, you know?

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.319
But this is the best fit for
Tamer, right?

00:05:38.339 --> 00:05:41.529
When someone disobeys him,
he'll just whip them back to shape!

00:05:42.410 --> 00:05:45.089
No, maybe there are
other ways to use it!

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:46.910
Like this, or that,
or those stuff!

00:05:47.439 --> 00:05:49.449
This, that, and those...

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:51.579
How inappropriate!

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:53.250
Rein won't do such a thing!

00:05:53.269 --> 00:05:56.750
What did you imagine?
My sister is quite the pervert!

00:05:56.779 --> 00:05:58.339
Geez, Runa!

00:05:59.459 --> 00:06:02.300
If you hit me like that,
it'll hurt, big sis!

00:06:02.319 --> 00:06:05.470
No, wait, Ouch! It really hurts!

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:07.600
This looks great.

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:11.519
A dagger? With your strength now,
I'm sure you can hold a better weapon, no?

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.850
But well, I'm used to it.

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:16.810
How beautiful!

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.220
What's with this
strange feeling...

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:21.230
From it looks,
it doesn't look bad at all, but...

00:06:21.819 --> 00:06:22.689
Hey!

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:25.160
Is this the best
weapon shop in town?

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:28.740
Give me the best-grade
weapon that'll fit me!

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.410
I have all the money you need!

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.160
Money, huh...

00:06:37.209 --> 00:06:38.629
How about this?

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:41.629
Whoa!
What a sharp-looking sword!

00:06:41.759 --> 00:06:44.930
This is the best sword ever!
I'll take it!

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.089
Come again...

00:06:49.139 --> 00:06:51.720
That was such a
beautiful sword...

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:53.639
Rein?

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.019
Excuse me.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:58.399
About that weapon,
the one you sold just now...

00:06:58.649 --> 00:07:00.779
Is that really the best you got?

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:03.779
What are you getting at?

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:09.620
It's good as a trophy, but in
a real fight, it's lacking something.

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:14.139
No, it's not just that weapon.
Every weapon here is the same.

00:07:16.579 --> 00:07:17.500
Don't tell me...

00:07:18.079 --> 00:07:19.839
You're actually
hiding something?

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:29.430
Quite an eye you got there, young boy!

00:07:29.449 --> 00:07:30.600
That's correct.

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:33.740
Those that I sold are things that
I can make even with one hand.

00:07:33.769 --> 00:07:37.689
It's a mass-produced thing that has
normal durability and sharpness.

00:07:38.139 --> 00:07:40.810
So you're making a lot of
money by scamming them!

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:44.149
I need to reevaluate
dwarfs in my mind...

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:46.699
Don't say it like that, you girls!

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:48.910
Even if its mass produced,
it's still made by a dwarf.

00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:51.529
I won't charge unfairly.

00:07:52.329 --> 00:07:53.160
But...

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:02.129
Compared to those I gave my all
creating, they don't stand a chance.

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:05.509
Just looking at it, you can know
that it's a whole different level...

00:08:05.959 --> 00:08:09.680
You can make such amazing weapon, but
why do you test your customers like that...

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:15.389
Well, It's just a little
exam for my customer.

00:08:15.769 --> 00:08:19.149
Lately, there are a lot of
customers who want the best weapon,

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:23.519
even without considering their
skills and match with the weapon.

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:26.810
The weapons that I put the effort into,

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:30.050
would also be thrown away
once they find a new one.

00:08:30.529 --> 00:08:33.740
After seeing that,
it all feels stupid.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:42.129
For us, weapon artisans,
our products are like our children...

00:08:42.539 --> 00:08:47.340
Am I an egoist for wanting them
to find a suitable partner?

00:08:51.009 --> 00:08:53.139
I totally understand
that feeling!

00:08:53.929 --> 00:08:57.769
Only a suitable person should wield
a first-rate product! Definitely!

00:08:58.559 --> 00:08:59.940
You can understand me?

00:09:00.070 --> 00:09:02.830
- Totally!
I'm an elite too after all!
- Seems like they're getting along, huh...

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:06.149
- Young girl,
you really got a good point there!
- I guess those with huge
pride get along well...

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:10.360
Next, it's my turn to ask.

00:09:11.149 --> 00:09:14.320
How did you manage to see the difference
between the weapons in this shop?

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:20.330
It's weird coming from me, but
it shouldn't be easily distinguishable.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:24.500
I don't have any confidence
in it, but if I have to say...

00:09:24.529 --> 00:09:26.879
It might be because
I'm a Beast Tamer.

00:09:28.419 --> 00:09:32.840
When we try to Tame animals,
we need to observe them.

00:09:33.049 --> 00:09:37.100
Maybe because of it, I end up having a habit
of observing everything, other than animals.

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:39.309
I think it has an effect.

00:09:40.269 --> 00:09:42.519
So it comes from your job, huh.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:45.269
Beast Tamer is amazing as always, huh?

00:09:45.299 --> 00:09:47.230
More like, it's just Rein.

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:50.029
Um, Why do you guys have
such an empty look?

00:09:50.049 --> 00:09:51.700
You'll know soon enough.

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:53.570
Your smiles are scary!

00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:54.950
I like you!

00:09:55.409 --> 00:09:58.409
I'll make a special
weapon, just for you.

00:09:58.870 --> 00:09:59.950
Really?!

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.539
That's great, Rein!

00:10:01.559 --> 00:10:02.159
Yeah!

00:10:02.159 --> 00:10:04.500
As I thought, an elite should
have a first-rate weapon too!

00:10:04.519 --> 00:10:06.309
It'll level up our adventure.

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:07.220
That's amazing!

00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:08.120
Once the sword is done,

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:08.720
- let's beat up something!

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:09.750
- But, I have a little problem.
- let's beat up something!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:10.610
- But, I have a little problem
- That's great!

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:11.519
- But, I have a little problem
- I agree!

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:14.759
I don't have the materials...

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:22.769
It's way more crowded
than usual, huh?

00:10:22.789 --> 00:10:25.269
Moreover,
everyone is in high spirits.

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:27.820
Natalie!

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:30.279
Oh, Kanade, good afternoon!

00:10:30.299 --> 00:10:31.279
Good afternoon!

00:10:31.299 --> 00:10:34.450
Hey, what's with the
big commotion today?

00:10:34.470 --> 00:10:36.029
Well...

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:41.289
It's because the Hero is recruiting support
members from our remote town, Horizon!

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:43.750
So those guys are still here...

00:10:43.769 --> 00:10:45.090
Though it's just supporting,

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:46.990
if you become one of the members
who defeats the Demon King,

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:51.250
you'll get glory and riches,
so everyone was attracted by it.

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:55.049
Rein?

00:11:02.919 --> 00:11:05.480
You know it, right?
I'm already fine.

00:11:06.309 --> 00:11:07.149
Yeah...

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:13.990
Excuse me, who are these girls?

00:11:14.399 --> 00:11:15.600
Good afternoon...

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:17.240
I'm Sora.

00:11:17.659 --> 00:11:20.799
I'm Runa! Treat me nicely, okay?

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:23.039
My name is Natalie.

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:25.210
Are they your
acquaintances, Rein?

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:26.029
Well...

00:11:26.059 --> 00:11:26.620
No!

00:11:26.649 --> 00:11:28.580
We're not just acquaintances!

00:11:28.610 --> 00:11:31.960
Let's just say, we have a
deep, intimate relationship.

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:32.480
What?!

00:11:33.299 --> 00:11:35.340
Rein, you did it with
such cute girls again...

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:37.190
Moreover,
they're really young...

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:38.889
Hold on, Natalie?!

00:11:38.909 --> 00:11:41.220
You're thinking of something
weird, aren't you?!

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:41.570
- Humans are pretty interesting!

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:43.809
- Natalie? Natalie!
- Humans are pretty interesting!

00:11:43.809 --> 00:11:45.059
Stop it, Runa!

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:48.769
In any case,
I'd like to receive this order.

00:11:49.059 --> 00:11:50.149
Let me check...

00:11:51.519 --> 00:11:53.110
It's an official request.

00:11:53.399 --> 00:11:56.740
An investigation into Mithril mountain
for Gantz, from the weapon shop.

00:11:56.759 --> 00:11:59.320
A designated request for Rein?

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:05.700
I need an ore called mithril
to make a special weapon.

00:12:05.909 --> 00:12:06.870
Mithril?

00:12:06.899 --> 00:12:11.580
That's right. It's said that weapons made by
mithril are so good they'll last a lifetime.

00:12:12.039 --> 00:12:14.250
But well,
it's really precious though.

00:12:15.169 --> 00:12:19.799
Luckily, my ancestors
left me with a mithril mountain,

00:12:19.799 --> 00:12:21.679
so I never had trouble with materials.

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:23.429
A rich guy!

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:24.679
However...

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:28.769
Since I came here, it seems like they
can't find any mithril there anymore...

00:12:28.789 --> 00:12:30.899
Does that mean it's depleted?

00:12:30.919 --> 00:12:32.899
No, I don't think
that's the case.

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:37.279
If the ore is depleted,
the harvest would've been reducing slowly.

00:12:37.299 --> 00:12:39.740
It's weird for it to
suddenly drop to zero.

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:42.240
Ah, I see...

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:46.620
Most probably,
there's a problem with the mine itself...

00:12:47.389 --> 00:12:51.580
Without mithril,
I can't make the best weapon for you.

00:12:52.169 --> 00:12:53.590
I'm sorry...

00:12:54.919 --> 00:12:58.009
If you have something in your
mind, you should say it, leader.

00:12:58.879 --> 00:13:00.379
It's shown on your face!

00:13:00.509 --> 00:13:02.720
You already know
what you want to do, right?

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:05.389
We'll follow you,
so just do whatever you want.

00:13:05.409 --> 00:13:08.730
If it's something that Rein has decided,
I'm sure no one will complain.

00:13:13.690 --> 00:13:14.649
Thank you.

00:13:15.059 --> 00:13:16.820
Why are you guys
whispering a lot?

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:20.490
About that mine,
won't you let us investigate it?

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:21.779
What did you say?

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:24.990
If there's a reason behind
the mithril depletion,

00:13:25.279 --> 00:13:27.330
I'm sure we can solve it
by doing an investigation.

00:13:28.539 --> 00:13:31.830
But I don't know what's happening
there, you know?

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:35.129
It's fine, even if we look like this,
we're still adventurers.

00:13:35.629 --> 00:13:36.389
What do you say?

00:13:39.879 --> 00:13:42.259
I'm sure this is some
kind of fate too.

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:45.389
I'll request it
for you guys then.

00:13:45.409 --> 00:13:46.720
Thank you.

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:48.720
Oh, right,
my name is Rein Shroud.

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:50.779
I'm Gantz Stoloff.

00:13:51.389 --> 00:13:53.230
I'll be counting on you, Rein.

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:57.070
Now, I'll need to decide
on your reward, huh.

00:13:57.269 --> 00:13:59.860
I'll pay you lots of gold.
How much do you want?

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:02.110
If that's so...

00:14:02.139 --> 00:14:04.110
I'd like the weapon made by you.

00:14:08.159 --> 00:14:11.200
You want my weapon
more than money, huh...

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:13.460
Is that a no go?

00:14:15.289 --> 00:14:16.460
No...

00:14:17.669 --> 00:14:19.549
That's the best answer!

00:14:21.879 --> 00:14:25.529
I thought Gantz
was a stubborn man at first,

00:14:25.539 --> 00:14:27.679
but it turns out he's
just a weapon mania!

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:31.679
That's right, and that Gantz
is going to make me a weapon,

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:34.059
we have to fulfill this request
no matter what!

00:14:40.529 --> 00:14:42.899
Turns out the mine is pretty close.

00:14:42.929 --> 00:14:45.029
Thanks to that,
we don't have to bring a lot of supplies.

00:14:45.049 --> 00:14:49.159
Yeah, rather than an adventure,
it's more like a picnic, it's fun!

00:14:49.179 --> 00:14:51.120
True, but...

00:14:52.159 --> 00:14:54.409
Seems like Sora and Runa
are having a hard time...

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:56.039
We're fine...

00:14:56.070 --> 00:14:59.509
This much is nothing at all...

00:14:59.529 --> 00:15:02.549
Big sis,
you don't have to act strong...

00:15:02.570 --> 00:15:04.919
I'm already half-dead...

00:15:06.509 --> 00:15:08.259
Are you two okay?!

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:10.850
I'm sorry, Rein.

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:14.980
The Fairy's evolution is focused on
magic, so we don't have the stamina...

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:17.200
Well,
no wonder you got exhausted.

00:15:17.230 --> 00:15:19.730
Yeah, today is pretty hot too,
after all...

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:21.399
Oh, right!

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:23.279
If I remember correctly,
there's something around here...

00:15:25.529 --> 00:15:26.909
It's a lake!

00:15:26.929 --> 00:15:28.490
It's super beautiful!

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:30.240
It's cold!

00:15:30.269 --> 00:15:31.870
Quite a nice place you got here, Rein!

00:15:31.889 --> 00:15:33.909
It was written on
the map of the mine.

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:35.870
I thought if we're going to
take a break, then this is the place.

00:15:35.899 --> 00:15:39.250
If that's so, can we play
in the water for a bit, Rein?

00:15:39.279 --> 00:15:40.919
That's nice,
playing in the water!

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:42.090
It's going to feel good!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:42.840
That's right!

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:44.090
It's okay, right? Rein?

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:45.549
Rein?

00:15:46.299 --> 00:15:48.590
Well, it's not good to
force ourselves so...

00:15:48.799 --> 00:15:51.049
Alright, you girls can go...

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:52.850
Yay!

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:55.679
Alright then, I'll be there
watching over our things...

00:15:55.710 --> 00:15:56.700
Wait, Kanade!

00:15:56.730 --> 00:15:59.149
Rein is still here,
think about it for a second!

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:01.649
I'm sorry, Rein.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:03.980
Geez...

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:06.860
Why is Kanade always
so carefree...

00:16:08.399 --> 00:16:09.110
Oh, right!

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:14.789
If Kanade and the others run into
danger, can you tell me about it?

00:16:17.639 --> 00:16:20.850
Alright,
I should take a break too then...

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:28.590
It's cold and it feels good!

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:29.840
Right, Tania?

00:16:29.929 --> 00:16:32.509
Yeah, this is not bad at all.

00:16:33.509 --> 00:16:35.059
Is something wrong?

00:16:35.429 --> 00:16:37.639
Ah, no, how do I say this...

00:16:37.889 --> 00:16:41.440
You two have quite big
breasts, huh...

00:16:41.519 --> 00:16:42.480
Is that so?

00:16:42.509 --> 00:16:44.320
Yeah, they're gigantic!

00:16:44.649 --> 00:16:46.149
On the other hand, for us...

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:48.610
I wonder what made
us so different...

00:16:48.639 --> 00:16:51.070
I'd like you to teach us
the way to make them bigger!

00:16:51.100 --> 00:16:52.320
Please!

00:16:52.350 --> 00:16:54.409
It'll grow in no time for you two too!

00:16:54.429 --> 00:16:55.580
That's right, maybe.

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:58.659
Tania!

00:16:59.409 --> 00:17:03.629
Runa! Don't get so desperate!
You made us look more pitiful!

00:17:06.839 --> 00:17:08.339
Runa!

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:12.299
I'm joining too!

00:17:17.519 --> 00:17:18.309
Kanade?!

00:17:19.039 --> 00:17:21.099
The animals weren't
reacting to anything though!

00:17:22.849 --> 00:17:24.480
What the heck
happened in the lake?!

00:17:28.779 --> 00:17:30.109
Kanade! Everyone!

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:32.759
Are you o... kay...?

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:47.250
Sorry!

00:17:54.589 --> 00:17:56.049
I'm really sorry...

00:17:56.079 --> 00:17:58.430
I didn't mean to peek at all...

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:01.140
Big sis, keep it together!
It's just small damage!

00:18:01.329 --> 00:18:02.190
- My naked body...

00:18:02.190 --> 00:18:04.519
- It's quite the situation
we got here, huh...
- My naked body...

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:06.519
I'm really sorry.

00:18:06.900 --> 00:18:08.690
I'll do anything,
so please forgive me!

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:12.490
You said anything,
just now, right?

00:18:12.509 --> 00:18:14.069
You're not going to take
back your words, right?

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:15.240
Yeah...

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.619
If that's so...

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:20.579
Just act normal, as always.

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:24.420
Well, being seen was
embarrassing as heck, but...

00:18:24.440 --> 00:18:27.500
You rushed in because you
heard my scream, right?

00:18:27.529 --> 00:18:29.589
Then Rein is not wrong at all.

00:18:29.609 --> 00:18:32.049
I'm much troubled if we became
awkward just because of this.

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:33.009
Yeah.

00:18:33.069 --> 00:18:35.130
In the first place,
I don't even mind at all!

00:18:35.339 --> 00:18:38.509
I'm embarrassed too, but,
I won't mind it anymore!

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:42.099
I really love this party after all,
so I'd like it to get along well as usual.

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:45.440
Thank you, everyone!

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:46.809
Oh right!

00:18:46.839 --> 00:18:49.369
While we're at it,
why don't you take a dip too, Rein?

00:18:50.069 --> 00:18:52.190
It's cold and feels good, you know!

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:54.839
Oh, so it's our turn to peep, huh?

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:57.849
Rein's naked body...

00:18:57.849 --> 00:18:59.619
I'll pass on that.

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:04.789
Even after that accident happened,
we continued without any problem,

00:19:04.809 --> 00:19:07.500
and finally, we reached the
mithril excavation site.

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:12.089
Hey Rein, we're not going in?

00:19:12.509 --> 00:19:16.880
Remember I said that it's weird that the
mithril collection suddenly falls to zero?

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:20.180
The only thing I can think of is...

00:19:20.230 --> 00:19:21.359
Illegal miners, huh?

00:19:22.269 --> 00:19:24.230
So that's why we're observing it...

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:27.900
I see, so even now,
there might be illegal miners inside!

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:30.059
I think the chance of it
being true is high.

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:34.240
That bird's movement...

00:19:36.740 --> 00:19:37.490
What?!

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:39.490
Keep it down!

00:19:39.519 --> 00:19:40.740
Hey, what is it?

00:19:40.769 --> 00:19:42.029
Is someone here?

00:19:42.059 --> 00:19:42.789
Rein...

00:19:42.809 --> 00:19:43.950
Come out!

00:19:44.539 --> 00:19:45.500
Let's attack them.

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:49.329
But I'd like to get information from
them, so be careful not to go overboard.

00:19:49.359 --> 00:19:50.170
Roger!

00:19:52.839 --> 00:19:55.720
I've told you not
to go overboard...

00:19:56.670 --> 00:20:01.049
That's not it!
This guy suddenly moved and hit my fist!

00:20:01.079 --> 00:20:02.140
Geez...

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:04.349
It's impossible to get
information from them, huh...

00:20:04.369 --> 00:20:05.430
Excuse me...

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:09.349
Should we try and peek inside
this guy's memory with magic?

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:11.480
Can you do something like that?

00:20:11.509 --> 00:20:15.240
Yes, Fairies have
unique magic after all.

00:20:15.259 --> 00:20:16.940
Just leave it to us!

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:20.069
Alright then, let's go.

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:24.410
Memory Search!

00:20:40.259 --> 00:20:42.140
It's as Rein had expected.

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:45.809
I can see these people
doing some illegal mining.

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:49.769
These 2 we defeated and...
Another 5 guys.

00:20:50.099 --> 00:20:52.150
Seems like all of them are adventurers.

00:20:52.559 --> 00:20:55.319
As I thought, the cause of the
shortage was illegal mining, huh...

00:20:55.339 --> 00:20:57.490
Moreover,
they're adventurers like us...

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:58.490
Excuse me...

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:02.109
Did we manage to
be useful to you?

00:21:02.779 --> 00:21:04.660
Yeah, you really helped me out.

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:05.990
Thank you, you two!

00:21:06.019 --> 00:21:07.250
If that's so...

00:21:07.269 --> 00:21:09.789
I'd like to request a pet!

00:21:11.170 --> 00:21:12.579
Pet?

00:21:12.609 --> 00:21:17.420
Kanade and Tania told us that the way you
pet them is like getting exclusive goods!

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:20.680
If that's so,
then we'd like to experience it too!

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:23.640
I don't think it's something to
look forward to like that though...

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:24.720
Well then...

00:21:25.599 --> 00:21:27.309
Good job, Sora, Runa.

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:32.599
It felt good!
And I'm feeling somewhat happy too!

00:21:32.630 --> 00:21:34.250
My heart is feeling aflutter!

00:21:34.269 --> 00:21:35.519
Is that so?

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:38.190
Okay then,
let's keep our guard up.

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:41.150
Now, we're going to strike
the excavation site.

00:21:42.109 --> 00:21:44.380
You can act as if you're
already noticed by the enemy.

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:45.369
That's right...

00:21:45.390 --> 00:21:47.490
But how did they
find out about us?

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:50.829
They were observing us from the sky.

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:55.789
That unnatural movement that
the bird from before made...

00:21:57.589 --> 00:21:58.710
Most probably...

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:02.259
There's a Beast Tamer
among the enemy.

00:22:28.950 --> 00:22:32.309
Everyone has been telling me to be myself

00:22:32.319 --> 00:22:36.890
But I don't really understand
what that means

00:22:36.900 --> 00:22:40.220
With a sigh and a crooked smile

00:22:40.220 --> 00:22:43.799
I strayed into the forest

00:22:43.799 --> 00:22:45.859
While feeling restless

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:50.890
If beyond the image of this world
that everyone says,

00:22:50.890 --> 00:22:54.509
There's a different world

00:22:54.529 --> 00:23:00.559
I want to find all the things I hold dear

00:23:00.559 --> 00:23:02.769
And keep count of them

00:23:02.789 --> 00:23:06.329
Please Please Me, please show me

00:23:06.349 --> 00:23:10.440
I'm holding out my hands,
and I want to be embraced by you

00:23:10.460 --> 00:23:14.109
Let me free, please smile

00:23:14.130 --> 00:23:18.490
The answer has always
been inside the mirror

00:23:18.509 --> 00:23:22.170
I look at the night sky
vacantly, and say

00:23:22.180 --> 00:23:25.539
Ah, the moon is beautiful

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:29.789
Please don't let this dream ends

00:23:36.519 --> 00:23:39.859
Next time,
Beast Tamer vs Beast Tamer.
